    return None
```

No node exists.

---

### Create Root

```python
root = Node(pre[preStart])
```

First preorder element is always the root.

---

### Leaf Node

```python
if preStart == preEnd:
    return root
```

Only one node remains.

---

### Left Subtree Root

```python
nextNode = pre[preStart+1]
```

Immediately after root comes the left subtree root.

---

### Linear Search

```python
while post[j] != nextNode:
    j += 1
```

Search inside reversed mirror traversal.

---

### Number of Left Subtree Nodes

```python
leftNodes = j-postStart+1
```

Calculate subtree size.

---

### Build Left Tree

```python
root.left = solve(...)
```

---

### Build Right Tree

```python
root.right = solve(...)
```

---

### Return Root

```python
